{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-28T19:43:41.897Z","data":{"text":"Task complete. Summary of the work:\n\n**Implementation**\n- **`src/watcher/archive-specs.ts`** (new): `applyArchiveSpecs` records the living `spec.md`/`osq.yml` for every capability folder under the change's `specs/` into `.run/archive-specs.json`, then applies deltas and sidecars. `restoreArchiveSpecs` puts recorded files back byte-for-byte, removes a capability folder left empty, deletes the record, and resolves whether a record existed. Also exports `archiveSpecsRecordPath`.\n- **`src/watcher/archiver.ts`**: split relocation into `relocateArchivedSpec` (drops the record and `plan-prompt.md` before the move). `archiveSpecFolder` keeps its signature and standalone delta/sidecar behavior. `checkAndArchiveSpec` restores first, keeps done check/audit/task verifies, applies deltas+sidecars, runs the change-level verify, restores and returns false on red, and relocates on success without a second apply.\n- **`src/watcher/loop.ts`**: `runWatcherCycle`'s worktree pre-check calls `restoreArchiveSpecs(change.tree.root, change.folderPath)` before `checkWorktree`.\n- **`tests/archive-specs-verify.test.ts`** (new): covers merged-spec verify, record shape, red-verify restore with `verify_red`, interrupted-archive recovery, prompt-file archive dropping the record, no-record no-op, and the interrupted-archive worktree scenario that archives instead of halting with `worktree_dirty`.\n\n**Verification**\n- Task verify `node --import tsx --test tests/archive-specs-verify.test.ts`: 7/7 pass.\n- Proposal verify `pnpm verify`: exit 0 (typechecks, build, full suite, lint all pass).\n\nThe one interpretation is recorded under `## Deviated` in the result file: the restore is placed at the start of the worktree pre-check block, since the earlier `checkWorktree` would otherwise halt a done worktree change before `archiveCompletedSpec` is reached."}}
